      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "I mean, there are other words you can use, but it's unnecessary. \nIf you're designing for something else to fit in/on/around you can apply GD&T stuff that basically outlines some tolerances on the part they may not have. \nOther stuff like form/fit/function, but again, a lot of this is just embedded into a mechanical drawing if you desire.",
